{
  "note": "Audiences with rulers (M17). Rulers belong to a party (a realm id today; lands beyond and powers without land can be added here later with no code changes). Traits and agendas shape how each ruler values every item and treaty. Values are in crowns: what an item is worth to the ruler weighing it. Trust runs 0 to 100 and is a lasting memory, separate from mood.",
