    "note": "M29 A: the titles a suzerain wins with each vassal, shown in its ruler's style; how petty rulers keep their distance (they ask a great power for an audience only at relation audienceAbove or more, or with an offer worth bigOffer crowns or more to the crown; otherwise, at requestChance a month, they send a short request as a dilemma); and middle and petty crowns' appetite for a war on a great power alone (its weight times middleVsGreat or pettyVsGreat).",
